SECURITY NOTE
-------------
The upstream repository also ships legacy signing material
(`vehicle-app/carlife.keystore`, `vehicle-app/debug.keystore`). Those files
are UNSAFE LEGACY CREDENTIALS and were deliberately NOT copied here and must
never be copied into DiPlay. DiPlay uses its own debug/release signing.

DEMO CHANNEL POLICY
-------------------
The upstream sample application passes demo channel / cuid values to
`CarLife.init`. Any such value used by the DiPlay compatibility probe is a
DEMO_CHANNEL — NOT FOR PRODUCTION — and CarLife compatibility with modern
phones remains UNVERIFIED until a real-device probe reaches
CONNECTION_ESTABLISHED.
